{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18260470","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18260470","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1826047001:1":{"text":"벌써 목숨을 구걸하는 건가. 참... 근성도 없지.","source_cn":"没想到你竟然这么快就求饶了，真是……没有骨气啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x017FECA5B1DFC9EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1826047002:1":{"text":"그래, 게임 하나 하지 않겠나?","source_cn":"不如这样，我们来做一个游戏如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D6E9143AB901C2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1826047003:1":{"text":"네가 정답을 맞히면 상을 주지. 하지만 틀리면... 벌을 줄 수밖에.","source_cn":"如果你能答对，我就给你奖励。但要是你答错了……我也只能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3534EBCB96E690E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1826047004:1":{"text":"사... 상은 필요 없어! 제발... 제발 살려줘!","source_cn":"我……我不要奖励！只求求……求求您放过我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB852060346B5624B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1826047005:1":{"text":"그건 네가 정할 일이 아니야.","source_cn":"那可不是你说了算的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76D6538A44128D8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1826047006:1":{"text":"너희 영주... 그 못된 꼬마 뱀파이어가 얼마동안 모습을 드러내지 않았지?","source_cn":"我问你，你们的领主……那个恶劣的小吸血鬼，有多久没出现了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCB201093439D11C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1826047007:1":{"text":"나... 나는 말단 귀족이라 영주님을 직접 뵐 수가...","source_cn":"我……我只是个小贵族，根本接触不到领主阁——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x710FD38FA734DC57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1826047008:1":{"text":"<shk>...으악!</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>——啊！！！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x319478B3A62DF551","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1826047009:1":{"text":"네 비명 소리를 듣는 건 즐겁지만, 주위를 좀 봐. 아직 내 은총을 기다리는 사람이 이렇게나 많잖아? 그러니 내 시간을 낭비하지 말고 잘 생각해서 대답하는 게 좋을 거야.","source_cn":"虽然我很享受你的尖叫，但看看周围——还有这么多人在等待...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29F71A7A2F95624F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1826047010:1":{"text":"말할게... 말하면 되잖아!","source_cn":"我、我说……我说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC03A0CEEEC014ECD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1826047011:1":{"text":"그게... 전면 통제 이후로 오션 오페라 극장의 공연이 중단되고 나서... 영주님을 뵌 적이 없어!","source_cn":"是从……从戒严以后，海歌剧院演出暂停……领主阁下就再也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90FE351E0EF0D109","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1826047012:1":{"text":"하, 하지만 크레센트 스트리트에서 폭발이 일어났을 때... 거리에서 봤다는 사람이 있었긴 해... 크게 다쳤다고도 했고...","source_cn":"不、不过，月弯街发生爆炸的时候……有人说在街上看到了她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DCE03962005AA3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1826047013:1":{"text":"그... 그게 사실인지는 몰라. 나도 직접 본 게 아니라서...","source_cn":"但是……但是我不知道那是不是真的，我没有亲眼见到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCC8C5D48BE743A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1826047014:1":{"text":"음... 그래, 제법 좋은 대답이야. 마음에 드는군.","source_cn":"嗯……这个问题你答得不错，我很满意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50D59295D6BDA4E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1826047015:1":{"text":"어디 보자, 무슨 상을 주면 좋을까...","source_cn":"让我想想，该奖励你什么才好呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x398AD5D23E37D5EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1826047016:1":{"text":"제발... 제발 살려줘!","source_cn":"求您……求您饶了我吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x338AC6A1B0E8FE9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1826047017:1":{"text":"살려달라고? 재미없는 제안이네.","source_cn":"饶了你？多么无趣的提议啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x290028C1E3AA222A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1826047018:1":{"text":"아, 그래. 너에게 줄 상은... 질문 하나에 더 대답하는 것으로 하지.","source_cn":"啊，我想到了。你的奖励是……再回答我一个问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB710351A680A8A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1826047019:1":{"text":"수선의 집 의사... 뮤리엘 할멈은 어디로 갔지?","source_cn":"修缮屋的医师——那个穆婆婆，她去哪了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7418284EC148C2CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1826047020:1":{"text":"나, 나도 몰라. 사라졌다고!","source_cn":"我、我不知道！她失踪了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFED6F2978B8CBCD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1826047021:1":{"text":"반티스에서는 할멈이 군사 기지를 파괴했다면서 지명 수배를 내렸어... 할멈을 잡으려고 전면 통제까지 했다고. 문밖에 나갈 엄두도 못 냈단 말이야.","source_cn":"班题斯说她破坏了军事基地，城里到处都是通缉令……军队为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75AA43A6B011349A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1826047022:1":{"text":"어쩌면... 벌써 군대에 붙잡힌 걸지도 모르지! 그, 그래... 실종된 지 이렇게 오래 지났으니까, 분명 잡혀간 거야!","source_cn":"说不定……说不定她已经被军队抓走了！对，对……她消失了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B174E38FBC9DEB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1826047023:1":{"text":"반티스 군대에 붙잡혀 갔다고? 후후...","source_cn":"被班题斯军队抓走了？呵呵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37904B4EA6F296DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1826047024:1":{"text":"그렇게 자신 있게 말하다니. 이제 그만 발버둥 치고 얌전히 벌을 받도록 해!","source_cn":"既然你这么信誓旦旦，那就别再挣扎了。乖乖受罚吧——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3A8CCC04332B9E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1826047025:1":{"text":"<shk>아... 안 돼! 으아악!</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>不……不要！！啊——！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB9404357E9DB22D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:斯莱泽":{"text":"슬레이저","source":"斯莱泽","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:贵族昆廷":{"text":"귀족 켄틴","source":"贵族昆廷","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":26,"localized_text_count":25,"speaker_count":2}}